source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A user target carries a title like any other; jiro keeps both in the link directive.
-- input.jira --
[x|~admin|t]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=admin" title="t" class="user-hover" rel="admin">admin</a></p>
-- want.md --
:link[x]{target="~admin" title="t"}
-- warnings.json --
[]
